                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "752644ae-2640-3639-b8d2-cbe2fb12f9b2",
                        "entry_id": "6c7371f4-075a-31e9-828f-fc696aa8d045",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to betray (to indicate)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "95d823eb-1203-4207-b76a-f055997ed935",
                                "sense_id": "752644ae-2640-3639-b8d2-cbe2fb12f9b2",
                                "text": "Па́клин неда́ром обзыва́л его́ аристокра́том; всё в нём изоблича́ло поро́ду: ма́ленькие у́ши, ру́ки, но́ги, не́сколько ме́лкие, но то́нкие черты́ лица́, не́жная ко́жа, пуши́стые во́лосы, са́мый го́лос, слегка́ карта́вый, но прия́тный.",
                                "translation": "Paklin had not been wrong in describing him as an aristocrat; everything in him betrayed good birth: his little ears, hands and feet, the delicate but rather small features of his face, his soft skin, his fluffy hair, even his rather mincing but musical voice.",
                                "english": "Paklin had not been wrong in describing him as an aristocrat; everything in him betrayed good birth: his little ears, hands and feet, the delicate but rather small features of his face, his soft skin, his fluffy hair, even his rather mincing but musical voice."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
